        "userPrompt": "user: Case PA-100002 is missing the clinical notes and the imaging report. Ask the provider to send both within 7 days.\n\nRelevant context:\n- [pgvector] A reviewer may ask the provider for missing documents before deciding a case.\n\nBased on the above, create a plan to address the user's request."
